  "body": "The one-way tickets are booked. Our vendors' move is locked in-and so is their decision to sell their stunning mainly concrete block home.\r\n\r\nFreshly finished, this four-bedroom Torbay home has been completely transformed with a clear modern Mediterranean vision, while sea views add to its relaxed coastal feel and being concrete and brick, it has effortless maintenance. \r\n\r\nTextured white walls, soft arches, natural timber and warm earthy tones create a home with genuine character and one cohesive design story. This is far more than a cosmetic refresh-every room has been thoughtfully reworked, leaving nothing to do but move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the impressive, light-filled living area. Open-plan, beautifully finished and anchored by a fireplace, it feels both stylish and genuinely inviting. Seamless flow onto the deck and large, private backyard creates an effortless setting for children, pets and summer entertaining.\r\n\r\nWith everything already completed, it also offers exceptional lock-and-leave ease-simply turn the key and start enjoying it.\r\n\r\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE IT:\r\n\r\n* Four bedrooms and two freshly renovated bathrooms\r\n* Impressive open-plan living anchored by a ethanol fireplace\r\n* Excellent indoor-outdoor flow to the deck and backyard\r\n* Five brand-new heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n* Sea views and a relaxed coastal outlook\r\n* Large, mostly flat and private backyard\r\n* Enclosed carport offering storage for bikes, boards, tools or projects\r\n* Stylish, low-fuss living with genuine lock-and-leave appeal\r\n* Zoned for Torbay School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College\r\n* Privately positioned off a quiet cul-de-sac\r\n* A friendly neighbourhood with genuinely great neighbours\r\n* An easy walk to local shops, schools, parks and everyday essentials\r\n\r\nTucked away in a quiet Torbay pocket, you can leave the car at home and walk to almost everything, while Long Bay Regional Park, Waiake Beach and Browns Bay are all just minutes away.\r\n\r\nScotland is calling and this home is priced to sell. Our vendors are committed to achieving a sale.\r\n\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35779",
